    "summary": "Support EBRD’s economic-policy and transition agenda across Sub-Saharan Africa from Abidjan. The analyst contributes country research, policy dialogue and investment-related analysis, including green-economy transition, structural reform and macroeconomic scenarios used by Banking teams in their investment work.",
    "aboutRole": "The role sits in the Regional Policy and Strategy team within Policy and Partnerships. Working with Banking, Policy Strategy and Delivery, and Climate Strategy and Delivery colleagues, the analyst helps connect country priorities, policy reforms and investment delivery. Assignments range from country diagnostics and strategies to transaction support, policy compacts, growth forecasts and briefings for internal decision-making.",
